# Skills: CI/CD

Purpose:
  CI/CD skills for SDDRA system. Defines how code is built,
  tested, and deployed automatically.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @pipeline.sdd
   3  @local-validation.sdd

Rules:
  [C1] All code MUST pass CI before merge.
  [C2] All tests MUST pass before deployment.
  [C3] All security scans MUST pass before merge.
  [C4] Production deployment requires human approval.
  [C5] All changes MUST be traceable to decisions.

Navigation:
  Pipeline: @pipeline.sdd
  LocalValidation: @local-validation.sdd

State: +
